    <item>
      <title>Pakua</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/en/work/pakua/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>contact@gabrielkimutai.com (Gabriel Kimutai)</author>
      <dc:creator>Gabriel Kimutai</dc:creator>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/en/work/pakua/</guid>
      <description>A marketplace and listing platform with Go APIs, real-time C2C messaging, and PostgreSQL-backed inventory.</description>
      <content:encoded>&lt;div class=&#34;project-meta&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;dl&gt;&#xA;&lt;dt&gt;Problem&lt;/dt&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;Build marketplace listing and inventory flows with reliable APIs and real-time customer-to-customer communication.&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;dt&gt;Stack&lt;/dt&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul class=&#34;tech-list&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Go&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;React&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;JSONB&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;WebSockets&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Docker&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;/dl&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Pakua is a marketplace / listing platform. The engineering focus is the &lt;strong&gt;backend architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: APIs, inventory modeling, and real-time C2C messaging — with a React/TypeScript client on top.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This page describes the systems shape of the work. It does not invent user counts, revenue, or confidential product metrics.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;problem&#34;&gt;Problem&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A marketplace needs more than static listings:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;consistent APIs for create/update/search flows&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;inventory state that stays coherent as listings change&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;direct communication between customers without turning the app into an email client&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;data models flexible enough for listing attributes without an unmaintainable schema explosion&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;architecture&#34;&gt;Architecture&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;goat svg-container &#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;svg&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;font-family=&#34;Menlo,Lucida Console,monospace&#34;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;viewBox=&#34;0 0 504 185&#34;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;g transform=&#39;translate(8,16)&#39;&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,0 L 152,0&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 240,0 L 392,0&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 168,16 L 224,16&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,32 L 152,32&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 240,32 L 312,32&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 312,32 L 392,32&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 200,64 L 312,64&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 312,64 L 424,64&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 136,112 L 264,112&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 360,112 L 488,112&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 136,160 L 264,160&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 360,160 L 488,160&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,0 L 0,32&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 136,112 L 136,160&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 152,0 L 152,32&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 200,64 L 200,96&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 240,0 L 240,32&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 264,112 L 264,160&#39; fill=&#39;none&#